{"status":"success","data":[{"download":{"data":{"site":{"notes":"Validation status: amber(see Dataset Notes)","siteid":38560,"dataset":{"agerange":[{}],"database":"Nonmarine Ostracod Distribution in Europe Database","datasetid":70598,"datasetpi":[{"initials":"W.","contactid":18686,"firstname":"W.","familyname":"Lilljeborg","contactname":"Lilljeborg, W."}],"datasetname":"NODE-R3847","datasettype":"ostracode surface sample","datasetnotes":"This Ostracoda dataset was uploaded as part of the bulk import of NODE (Non-marine Ostracod Distribution in Europe) to Neotoma in 2026, using the DataBUS upload system (https://github.com/NeotomaDB/DataBUS). This database import was coordinated by Alison Smith, David Horne, Robin Smith, Andrew Anderson, Simon Goring, Socorro Dominguez, and Jack Williams. David Horne is the lead steward for the NODE database which was originally established by members of the EU Human Capital and Mobility Programme project “Evolutionary ecology of reproductive modes in non-marine Ostracoda” (1994-1996), primarily to enable mapping of sexual and parthenogenetic reproductive modes.  Further development of NODE has included continued data entry, application of taxonomic revisions, and validation exercises using Google Earth and other online resources to check, correct and refine the coordinates of every record. Each record is assigned a Validation Status colour: green (accurate), amber (as good as possible given limitations of published information) or red (uncertain or unreliable and in need of further checking). Users are advised to check the Validation Status (in Site Notes) of the data they map and consider eliminating any that are “red”. Species occurrence records are derived mainly from published literature spanning the 19th, 20th and 21st centuries and represent specimens that were (or are assumed to have been) collected alive. Taxonomic names have been updated in accordance with the global checklist of Meisch et al. (2024: https://doi.org/10.5852/ejt.2024.974.2767) but NODE also includes the original “Name in Reference” as given in the source of the occurrence record (see Collection Unit Notes).\\nNODE records include additional metadata such as environmental classifications of sites and taxonomic/nomenclatural comments that are being prepared for future import to Neotoma."},"sitename":"Uppsala + ","geography":"{\"type\":\"Point\",\"crs\":{\"type\":\"name\",\"properties\":{\"name\":\"EPSG:4326\"}},\"coordinates\":[17.63944,59.85861]}","collectionunit":{"notes":"Accepted name: Cypris pubera (O.F. Mueller, 1776), Name in reference: Cypris pubera O.F. Muller | Accepted name: Eucypris ornata (O.F. Mueller, 1776), Name in reference: Cypris ornata O.F. Muller | Accepted name: Eucypris crassa (O.F. Mueller, 1785), Name in reference: Cypris dromedarius S. Fischer | Accepted name: Stenocypria fischeri (Lilljeborg, 1883), Name in reference: Cypris fischeri nom.nov. (pro Cypris fasciata Fischer) | Accepted name: Eucypris virens (Jurine, 1820), Name in reference: Cypris virens (Jurine) | Accepted name: Bradleystrandesia fuscata (Jurine, 1820), Name in reference: Cypris fuscata (Jurine) | Accepted name: Bradleystrandesia reticulata (Zaddach, 1844), Name in reference: Cypris affinis S. Fischer | Accepted name: Bradleystrandesia hirsuta (Fischer, 1851), Name in reference: Cypris hirsuta S Fischer | Accepted name: Heterocypris incongruens (Ramdohr, 1808), Name in reference: Cypris incongruens Ramdohr | Accepted name: Ilyocypris gibba (Ramdohr, 1808), Name in reference: Cypris gibba Ramdohr | Accepted name: Tonnacypris lutaria (Koch, 1838), Name in reference: Cypris strigata O.F. Muller | Accepted name: Cypria exsculpta (Fischer, 1855), Name in reference: Cypria exsculpta (S.Fischer) | Accepted name: Cypria ophtalmica (Jurine, 1820), Name in reference: Cypris compressa (Baird) | Accepted name: Potamocypris villosa (Jurine, 1820), Name in reference: Cypridopsis villosa (Jurine) | Accepted name: Paralimnocythere relicta (Lilljeborg, 1863), Name in reference: Limnicythere relicta (Lilljeborg)","handle":"NODE-R3847","gpslocation":{},"collunittype":"Modern","collectionunit":"NODE-R3847","collectionunitid":52056}},"samples":[{"ages":[{}],"datum":[{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":14501,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Cypria ophtalmica","ecologicalgroup":"NKBE"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":14517,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Ilyocypris gibba","ecologicalgroup":"NKBE"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":14525,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Cypris pubera","ecologicalgroup":"NKBE"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":14542,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Eucypris crassa","ecologicalgroup":"NKBE"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":14558,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Heterocypris incongruens","ecologicalgroup":"NKBE"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":14645,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Bradleystrandesia reticulata","ecologicalgroup":"NKBE"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":49483,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Potamocypris villosa","ecologicalgroup":"NKBE"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":49864,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Stenocypria fischeri","ecologicalgroup":"BNTH"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":50036,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Tonnacypris lutaria","ecologicalgroup":"NKBE"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":50058,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Bradleystrandesia fuscata","ecologicalgroup":"NKBE"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":50078,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Eucypris ornata","ecologicalgroup":"NKBE"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":50079,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Eucypris virens","ecologicalgroup":"NKBE"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":50603,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Bradleystrandesia hirsuta","ecologicalgroup":"NKBE"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":50687,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Paralimnocythere relicta","ecologicalgroup":"BNTH"},{"units":"present/absent","value":1,"context":"live","element":"unspecified","taxonid":50792,"taxongroup":"Ostracode","elementtype":"unspecified","variablename":"Cypria exsculpta","ecologicalgroup":"NKBE"}],"sampleid":1457367,"sampleanalyst":[{"initials":"D.J.","contactid":18466,"firstname":"David","familyname":"Horne","contactname":"Horne, David"}],"analysisunitid":1301327}]},"chronologies":{"chronologies":[{"chronology":{"chroncontrols":[{"geochron":{}}]}}]}}}],"message":"Retrieved all tables"}